rity":"bridge","target":{"mode":"bridge","ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","kind":"node-class","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"key":"person","label":"Person"},"resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"bridge":{"ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"]},"_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","targetKind":"node-class","classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"}}},{"id":"robert-barnes-detail","type":"port","label":"Robert Barnes","position":{"x":0,"y":-900},"width":720,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph","portId":"root","name":"Robert Barnes"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Robert Barnes"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 👤 Robert Barnes\n\n![Portrait of Robert Barnes](https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/592445e6be6594a48940de2b/1524575002649-4T6F23RSWJNT4VE153DX/BARNES_LAW_HOME_robert_barnes_2018_.jpg)\n\n**attorney · political commentator · podcaster**\n\nAmerican attorney and political commentator, founder of Barnes Law LLP and co-host of the Viva & Barnes legal-commentary program.\n\n*Portrait: Barnes Law LLP website.*"}},{"id":"robert-barnes-person","type":"person","label":"Robert Barnes","position":{"x":0,"y":-300},"width":500,"height":340,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"displayName":"Robert Barnes","fullName":"Robert Edward Barnes","aliases":[],"summary":"American attorney and political commentator, founder of Barnes Law LLP and co-host of the Viva & Barnes legal-commentary program.","portrait":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/592445e6be6594a48940de2b/1524575002649-4T6F23RSWJNT4VE153DX/BARNES_LAW_HOME_robert_barnes_2018_.jpg","birthDate":"1974-04-11","deathDate":"","pronouns":"","nationality":"American","primaryRoles":["attorney","political commentator","podcaster"],"canonicalUri":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/robert-barnes.node","status":"published","definitionKey":"person","_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"}}},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-1","type":"markdown","label":"Background and education","position":{"x":-900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Background and education\n\nRobert Edward Barnes was born in 1974 and grew up in East Ridge, Tennessee. His firm biography describes a working-class childhood, a scholarship to the McCallie School, time at Yale, and legal education at the University of Wisconsin. Barnes has built much of his public persona around representing people he describes as underdogs and around constitutional, tax, civil-rights, and politically charged disputes."}},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-2","type":"markdown","label":"Legal career","position":{"x":0,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Legal career\n\nBarnes founded Barnes Law LLP and has practiced in areas including criminal tax, constitutional litigation, and civil-rights disputes. His firm's materials highlight his role on Wesley Snipes' tax-defense team and a broader history of high-profile and unconventional cases. Public federal court filings identify Robert E. Barnes as California Bar No. 235919 and counsel through Barnes Law."}},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-3","type":"markdown","label":"Media and commentary","position":{"x":900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Media and commentary\n\nBarnes also became a media personality through legal and political commentary. He is widely associated with the *Viva & Barnes: Law for the People* program with Canadian lawyer David Freiheit, where legal cases, elections, civil liberties, and political controversies are discussed from Barnes' perspective."}},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-4","type":"markdown","label":"Lionel episode context","position":{"x":-450,"y":650},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Lionel episode context\n\nIn Lionel Template v1 Example 01, Barnes is part of the Actor Field and the wider research/commentary network Lionel describes. The episode uses him as an example of a lawyer-commentator whose analysis circulates through the same information ecosystem as Candace Owens, Baron Coleman, and other independent commentators."}},{"id":"robert-barnes-sources","type":"markdown","label":"Sources","position":{"x":0,"y":1150},"width":900,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"robert-barnes-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Sources and photo provenance\n\n- **Barnes Law LLP**, *About Robert Barnes*  \n  https://www.barneslawllp.com/about\n- **Barnes Law LLP**, *Barnes Law home / professional profile*  \n  https://www.barneslawllp.com/\n- **U.S. District Court filing**, *Robert E. Barnes, Cal. Bar #235919*  \n  https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCOURTS-caed-2_18-cv-01269/pdf/USCOURTS-caed-2_18-cv-01269-0.pdf\n- **Wikipedia**, *Robert Barnes (attorney)*  \n  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Barnes_(attorney)\n\n**Portrait URL:** https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/592445e6be6594a48940de2b/1524575002649-4T6F23RSWJNT4VE153DX/BARNES_LAW_HOME_robert_barnes_2018_.jpg\n**Photo note:** Portrait: Barnes Law LLP website.\n\n**Lionel context:** `github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/example-01-associative-realignment.node`"}}],"edges":[{"id":"robert-barnes-section-edge-1","source":"robert-barnes-person","target":"robert-barnes-section-1","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-edge-2","source":"robert-barnes-person","target":"robert-barnes-section-2","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-edge-3","source":"robert-barnes-person","target":"robert-barnes-section-3","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"robert-barnes-section-edge-4","source":"robert-barnes-person","target":"robert-barnes-section-4","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"